<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz bond issue underwritten.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz bond issue underwritten.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish state-owned  Bank Pekao SA has underwritten the entire 13-million-zloty convertible bond issue by construction company Elektromontaz Export, Elektromontaz said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said the stand-by fee was 2.65 percent.</p>
<p>Elektromontaz has said the 130 bonds will be offerred to selected investors and will carry an annual eight-percent coupon.</p>
<p>Each bond, which has a par value of 100,000 zlotys, would be exchangeable for 20,000 shares.</p>
<p>Elektromontaz has said it would offer the bonds at or above par and the final issue price would be set through a tender.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
